<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>You're invited to Learnalyze</title>
<style>
  body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f6f8; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; }
  .container { max-width: 520px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); overflow: hidden; }
  .header { background: #0f172a; padding: 32px 32px 24px; text-align: center; }
  .header h1 { color: #ffffff; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0; }
  .body { padding: 32px; color: #334155; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .body p { margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .body .details { background: #f0f9ff; border: 1px solid #bae6fd; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 20px 0; }
  .body .details strong { color: #0369a1; }
  .body .details p { margin: 4px 0; }
  .button { display: inline-block; background: #0f172a; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; margin: 24px 0 8px; }
  .footer { padding: 24px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; text-align: center; }
  .footer a { color: #64748b; }
  .expiry { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 8px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <div class="header">
    <h1>Learnalyze</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="body">
    <p>Hello,</p>
    <p>{{inviter_name}} has invited you to join {{school_name}} on Learnalyze as a {{role}}.</p>

    <div class="details">
      <p><strong>Role:</strong> {{role}}</p>
      {{department_detail}}
      {{subject_detail}}
    </div>

    <p>Click the button below to accept your invitation and set up your account.</p>

    <a class="button" href="{{invite_link}}">Accept invitation</a>

    <p class="expiry">This invitation expires in 7 days.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    <p>Learnalyze &mdash; AI-powered teaching insights</p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
